Message  : [entropy_src] Lock up Ack SM upon fatal local events, align scoreboard
========================================================================

--- RTL DIFF (what changed in the design) ---
commit 57f9776639e938193dfc15c3bcc6c208f07e321d
Author: Pirmin Vogel <vogelpi@lowrisc.org>
Date:   Mon Sep 22 23:11:02 2025 +0200

    [entropy_src] Lock up Ack SM upon fatal local events, align scoreboard
    
    This commit modifies the RTL to move the Ack SM into the terminal error
    state whenever a fatal local event is observed. Previously, the Ack SM
    would only move to this state upon observing one particular fatal error
